--- !u!114 &568154449
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 568154445}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d03077da48b21f44aba8fbb497b9b819, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialDialogue
  conversationBox: {fileID: 1920141050}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1517776747}
  gameplayImageContainer: {fileID: 1518988077}
  gameplayImageDisplay1: {fileID: 1236976122}
  gameplayImageDisplay2: {fileID: 1326392645}
  gameplayImageDisplay3: {fileID: 0}
  gameplayImageSize: {x: 800, y: 500}
  tutorialSteps:
  - sentence: Greetings player!
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Congrats for completing your training from the SPF.
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Now you are a real police officer now!
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: To put your skills to the test, I have a mission for you.
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: "There\u2019s a community at the West side that needs an officer to
      guard its safety."
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Seems like you would be suitable for the role.
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: You look nervous, not need to worry! It's very easy!
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: 'Here''s a 3 step rule:'
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Firstly, spot the danger! Catch the danger on time before accident
      happen!
    showImages: 1
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d32d03b7e8612d46a2425ec5a46587c, type: 3}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Secondly, spoke to them! As a police officer, it's a must to inform
      residents to be aware of risks and dangers on roads.
    showImages: 1
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
    gameplayImage2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4faf9b9eea8aa754a9c1d2561c5405d8, type: 3}
    gameplayImage3: {fileID: 0}
  - sentence: Lastly, repeat! It's your duty to keep the community safe and sound.
      Good luck!
    showImages: 0
    gameplayImage1: {fileID: 0}
